        "original_id": "3bdfca68-7c7b-5353-80fd-05c75a7d337f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: The Futureheads, Marcy Playground\n- People: Ross Millard, Barry Hyde, David \"Jaff\" Craig, Dave Hyde, John Wozniak, Dylan Keefe, Shlomi Lavie\n- Album: News and Tributes\n- Places: Sunderland\n- Genres: Post-punk, alternative rock\n\nFacts:\n- The Futureheads were an English post-punk band from Sunderland.\n- The Futureheads consisted of Ross Millard on vocals and guitar, Barry Hyde on vocals and guitar, David \"Jaff\" Craig on bass guitar, and Dave Hyde on drums.\n- On 29 May 2006, The Futureheads released News and Tributes as their second full-length album.\n- Marcy Playground is an American alternative rock band consisting of John Wozniak on lead vocals and guitar, Dylan Keefe on bass, and Shlomi Lavie on drums.",
